{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2022-09-13 06:30:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN TO RING THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET OPENING BELL', 'text': "MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC) TODAY WILL OPEN THE NASDAQ STOCK MARKET TO COMMEMORATE THE 90TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE COMPANY'S FOUNDING AS A STORE-FRONT PHARMACY IN QUEENS, NEW YORK DURING THE GREAT DEPRESSION. “TODAY, WE ARE EXCITED TO CELEBRATE THE BOLD STEP HENRY SCHEIN TOOK IN 1932 TO ESTABLISH OUR COMPANY AT A TIME OF GREAT ECONOMIC TURMOIL. AND WHAT BETTER WAY TO DO SO THAN BY JOINING THE EXCEPTIONAL TEAM AT NASDAQ TO RING THE OPENING BELL,” SAID STANLEY M"}